# inc-caq8 dim/lowlight: an elf reads a scroll on a dim square. Elves have
# CA_LOWLIGHT 2 and no infravision (lib/races.irh, "elf;temp"), so low-light
# vision must treat the dim square as bright: no +10 DC. This is the dim case
# of tools/keys/read-light-dim.keys, preceded by a page dismissal: the elf
# fixture's arrival greeting overflows the message window ("-- more --"),
# which the human/orc fixtures do not, and the setup's first key otherwise
# lands in the pager instead of the game.
@while "more --" SPACE
@include read-light-setup.keys
w K RIGHT ENTER e
w K RIGHT*2 ENTER e
w K RIGHT*2 ENTER P
# Stow the equipped light source; the magma source placed above supplies the
# dim level instead.
i c s ESC
s
r
@choose "(in pack) 2 Scrolls of Wizard Sight"
@while "Stop reading?" n
@dump:read
v
@dump:rolls
ESC
i
@dump:after-pack
ESC
r
@dump:after-scrolls
ESC
@quit
